      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1945,
      "text": "[We sent them] with clear proofs and scriptures, and We have sent down to you [O Prophet] the Reminder to explain to people what has been sent down to them, and so that they may reflect.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 229,
      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1946,
      "text": "Do those who devise evil plots feel secure that Allah will not make them sink into the earth or that the punishment will not come upon them from where they do not expect?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 229,
      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1947,
      "text": "Or that He may seize them while they are going about[27], and they will have no escape?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 46,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 229,
      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1948,
      "text": "Or that He will seize them when they are in a state of fear? But your Lord is indeed Ever Gracious, Most Merciful[28].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 47,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 229,
      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1949,
      "text": "Do they not see the things that Allah has created, how their shadows incline to the right and left, prostrating[29] to Allah in all humility?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 48,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 229,
      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1950,
      "text": "To Allah prostrates[30] all that is in the heavens and on earth of living things, and so do the angels; and they do not show arrogance.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 49,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 229,
      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1951,
      "text": "They fear their Lord above them, and they do what they are commanded.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 50,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 229,
      "hizbQuarter": 108,
      "sajda": {
