        "recommended": true,
        "obligatory": false
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 1952,
      "text": "Allah said, “Do not take two gods[31]. He is only One God, so fear Me alone.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 51,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 230,
      "hizbQuarter": 109,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1953,
      "text": "To Him belongs all that is in the heavens and earth, and constant devotion is to Him alone. Will you then fear anyone other than Allah?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 52,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 272,
      "ruku": 230,
      "hizbQuarter": 109,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1954,
      "text": "Whatever blessing you have, it is from Allah. Then when you are afflicted with hardship, to Him alone you cry out for help[32].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 53,
      "juz": 14,
